  "details": "Playstation\n\nI propose to port VRChat to Playstation, the Latest Playstation offers a VR Headset that comes by standard, additionally \"PlayStation 5 has surpassed 63 million units sold worldwide as of Q2 2025\" which makes it a very worth porting. \n\nXBOX\n\nXBOX is a notoriously known platform for cross-platform games, and as google says \"Xbox Series X|S sold 32.98 million units\" and that is more than quest 2 and 3 summed together (roughly 28million units) and considering that most of those quest 2 are probably broken right now the XBOXes around are a high number, high enough to consider a port for VRChat. \n\nNintendo Switch\n\nwe all know how famous is the Nintendo Switch and its various ported games, it is powerful enough to run windows as some people found out by shorting it out, and so i propose porting VRChat (Android or IOS) to the Nintendo Switch, the amount of units sold makes it a very valuable platform as \" 150.86 million units of the hybrid handheld/home console had been sold as of 31 December 2024.\" and it is likely that even more have been sold as of today, which makes it highly worth porting to VRChat.",
